<title>FRANCE: Moroccan millers pass Argentine wheat tender.</title>
<headline>Moroccan millers pass Argentine wheat tender.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moroccan millers have passed up offers in a tender for the import of 20,000 tonnes of Argentine wheat, European grain traders said on Friday.</p>
<p>The wheat was for delivery between December 20 and 30.</p>
<p>Traders did not know if and when the millers planned to re-tender for the wheat.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
